{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "PostPocket API",
    "version": "0.2.1",
    "description": "Kontrak API rilis 1 antara frontend (`apps/web`) dan backend (Supabase Edge Functions).\nRilis 1 hanya melayani surat yang dikirim; Pocket, TV, dan Booth tetap di browser.\n\n**Alur pengirim**\n\n1. `POST /letters` dengan `design`, `content`, dan metadata semua berkas. Server membuat\n   draf dan mengembalikan `editToken` serta URL upload bertanda tangan per berkas.\n2. Browser mengunggah tiap berkas langsung ke Storage (tidak lewat Edge Function), misalnya\n   `supabase.storage.from('letter-assets').uploadToSignedUrl(path, token, file)`.\n   URL upload berlaku 2 jam. Kalau mengunggah dengan PUT sendiri, kirim header\n   `content-type`, `x-upsert: false`, dan `cache-control: max-age=3600`. Tanpa\n   `cache-control`, Storage menyajikan berkasnya dengan `no-cache` dan browser mengunduhnya\n   ulang setiap kali (`uploadToSignedUrl` sudah mengirimnya sendiri).\n3. `POST /letters/{id}/publish` dengan header `X-Edit-Token`. Server memeriksa semua berkas\n   sudah ada dan sesuai metadata, membuat `slug`, lalu mengembalikan link surat.\n\n**Alur penerima**\n\n1. Halaman `/l/{slug}` di-SSR dan memanggil `GET /l/{slug}`. Panggilan ini tidak menandai\n   surat sebagai dibuka, jadi crawler WhatsApp aman.\n2. Saat penerima mengetuk kartu, frontend memanggil `POST /l/{slug}/open`.\n\n**Masa berlaku**\n\n- Draf yang tidak di-publish dihapus 24 jam setelah dibuat.\n- Surat, gambar OG, dan semua berkasnya dihapus 30 hari setelah publish (`expiresAt`).\n- Foto isi surat dihapus 7 hari setelah surat pertama kali dibuka (`photosExpireAt`).\n  Kalau gambar depannya foto user (`design.illustration = \"upload\"`), cover dan gambar OG\n  ikut dihapus saat itu, karena gambar OG memuat foto yang sama. Setelah dihapus, field\n  URL-nya bernilai `null` dan frontend menampilkan placeholder.\n- Job pembersihan berjalan tiap jam, tapi `GET /l/{slug}` sudah menyembunyikan berkas tepat\n  saat masanya lewat: surat jadi `404` begitu `expiresAt` lewat, dan foto (serta cover dan\n  OG kalau gambar depannya foto user) tidak dikembalikan lagi begitu `photosExpireAt` lewat.\n  Klien tidak pernah menerima URL berkas yang sudah dihapus.\n\n**Header umum**\n\n- `apikey`: publishable key Supabase, wajib di semua request (dikirim otomatis oleh\n  `supabase.functions.invoke`). Tanpa header ini, atau kalau isinya bukan publishable key\n  proyek, server menjawab `401` dengan kode `unauthorized`.\n- `X-Edit-Token`: khusus publish dan hapus.\n\n**CORS**\n\n- Origin yang diizinkan: `https://postpocket.vercel.app`, `http://localhost:3000`, dan\n  preview yang cocok dengan regex\n  `^https://postpocket-[a-z0-9-]+-haikalfaruqs-projects\\.vercel\\.app$`. Origin yang cocok\n  dikembalikan apa adanya di `Access-Control-Allow-Origin` (bukan `*`), ditambah\n  `Vary: Origin`.\n- Preflight `OPTIONS` dijawab `204` dengan `Access-Control-Allow-Methods: GET, POST,\n  DELETE, OPTIONS` dan `Access-Control-Allow-Headers: apikey, authorization,\n  content-type, x-client-info, x-edit-token`.\n- Upload berkas ke `signedUrl` (PUT, tanpa supabase-js juga boleh) dilayani Storage, bukan\n  Edge Function, jadi tidak lewat aturan CORS di atas.\n\nBatas angka `content` sama dengan `contentLimits` di\n`packages/presets/src/letter-content.ts`, dan backend memvalidasi dengan angka yang sama.\n"
  },
  "servers": [
    {
      "url": "https://{projectRef}.supabase.co/functions/v1",
      "variables": {
        "projectRef": {
          "default": "rmyfkdtqcltawmssollb",
          "description": "Ref proyek Supabase. Proyek staging memakai ref-nya sendiri."
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "security": [
    {
      "publishableKey": []
    }
  ],
  "tags": [
    {
      "name": "Pengirim",
      "description": "Membuat, menerbitkan, dan menghapus surat. Fungsi `letters`."
    },
    {
      "name": "Penerima",
      "description": "Membaca surat lewat slug. Fungsi `l`."
    }
  ],
  "paths": {
    "/letters": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "Pengirim"
        ],
        "operationId": "createLetter",
        "summary": "Buat draf surat dan URL upload",
        "description": "Anonim boleh, kena rate limit per IP (awal: 10 surat per jam). Server memvalidasi\n`design` dan `content`, lalu memastikan:\n\n- `photos[].key` sama persis dengan kunci `photo` di `content.elements` (urutan bebas);\n- `cover` wajib ada kalau `design.illustration` bernilai `upload`, dan harus kosong\n  kalau tidak;\n- `replyTo`, kalau diisi, adalah slug surat yang masih berlaku.\n\n`editToken` hanya dikirim sekali di respons ini. Simpan di IndexedDB pengirim; server\nhanya menyimpan hash-nya.\n",
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/CreateLetterRequest"
              },
              "example": {
                "design": {
                  "illustration": "upload",
                  "shape": "portrait",
                  "foilMode": "detail",
                  "foilBorder": true,
                  "foilColor": "gold",
                  "paper": "cream",
                  "template": "photo-1"
                },
                "content": {
                  "version": 1,
                  "elements": [
                    {
                      "kind": "photo",
                      "id": "e1",
                      "x": 0.5,
                      "y": 0.32,
                      "width": 0.7,
                      "rotation": -3,
                      "photo": "p1",
                      "aspect": 1.33
                    },
                    {
                      "kind": "text",
                      "id": "e2",
                      "x": 0.5,
                      "y": 0.72,
                      "width": 0.8,
                      "rotation": 0,
                      "text": "Selamat ulang tahun!",
                      "size": 0.07,
                      "align": "center"
                    },
                    {
                      "kind": "sticker",
                      "id": "e3",
                      "x": 0.84,
                      "y": 0.12,
                      "width": 0.18,
                      "rotation": 12,
                      "sticker": "heart"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                "cover": {
                  "type": "image/jpeg",
                  "width": 1536,
                  "height": 2048,
                  "size": 412000
                },
                "photos": [
                  {
                    "key": "p1",
                    "type": "image/webp",
                    "width": 2048,
                    "height": 1536,
                    "size": 380000
                  }
                ],
                "og": {
                  "type": "image/jpeg",
                  "width": 1200,
                  "height": 630,
                  "size": 110000
                },
                "replyTo": null
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "201": {
            "description": "Draf dibuat.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/CreateLetterResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Invalid"
          },
          "422": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unprocessable"
          },
          "429": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/RateLimited"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/letters/{id}/publish": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "Pengirim"
        ],
        "operationId": "publishLetter",
        "summary": "Terbitkan surat",
        "description": "Memeriksa semua berkas di Storage: ada, tipe sesuai, ukuran dan dimensi sama dengan\nmetadata di `POST /letters` dan tidak melewati batas. Server juga membuang metadata\nEXIF yang tersisa sebagai lapis kedua. Kalau lolos, server membuat `slug` dan status\nsurat menjadi `sent`.\n",
        "security": [
          {
            "publishableKey": [],
            "editToken": []
          }
        ],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/LetterId"
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Surat terbit.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/PublishLetterResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized"
          },
          "404": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/NotFound"
          },
          "409": {
            "description": "Surat sudah pernah terbit. Body berisi slug dan link yang sama.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/PublishLetterResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "422": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unprocessable"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/letters/{id}": {
      "delete": {
        "tags": [
          "Pengirim"
        ],
        "operationId": "deleteLetter",
        "summary": "Hapus surat beserta semua berkasnya",
        "description": "Berlaku untuk draf maupun surat yang sudah terbit. Link langsung mati.",
        "security": [
          {
            "publishableKey": [],
            "editToken": []
          }
        ],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/LetterId"
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "204": {
            "description": "Surat dan berkasnya dihapus."
          },
          "401": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized"
          },
          "404": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/NotFound"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/l/{slug}": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "Penerima"
        ],
        "operationId": "getLetter",
        "summary": "Ambil surat untuk halaman penerima",
        "description": "Publik. Draf, surat yang sudah kedaluwarsa, dan surat yang dihapus sama-sama\nmenghasilkan 404. Tidak mengubah `openedAt`.\n",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Slug"
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Surat ditemukan.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Letter"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "404": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/NotFound"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/l/{slug}/open": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "Penerima"
        ],
        "operationId": "openLetter",
        "summary": "Tandai surat dibuka",
        "description": "Dipanggil saat penerima mengetuk kartu. Idempoten: panggilan pertama mengisi\n`openedAt` dan menjadwalkan penghapusan foto, panggilan berikutnya mengembalikan nilai\nyang sama tanpa mengubah apa pun.\n",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Slug"
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Waktu dibuka dan jadwal penghapusan foto.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/OpenLetterResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "404": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/NotFound"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "components": {
    "securitySchemes": {
      "publishableKey": {
        "type": "apiKey",
        "in": "header",
        "name": "apikey",
        "description": "Publishable key Supabase (`sb_publishable_…`)."
      },
      "editToken": {
        "type": "apiKey",
        "in": "header",
        "name": "X-Edit-Token",
        "description": "Token dari respons `POST /letters`. Disimpan di browser pengirim."
      }
    },
    "parameters": {
      "LetterId": {
        "name": "id",
        "in": "path",
        "required": true,
        "schema": {
          "type": "string",
          "format": "uuid"
        }
      },
      "Slug": {
        "name": "slug",
        "in": "path",
        "required": true,
        "schema": {
          "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Slug"
        }
      }
    },
    "responses": {
      "Invalid": {
        "description": "Body bukan JSON yang valid atau tidak sesuai skema.",
        "content": {
          "application/json": {
            "schema": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "Unprocessable": {
        "description": "Bentuknya benar tapi isinya ditolak, misalnya id preset tidak dikenal, kunci foto tidak\ncocok dengan `content`, `replyTo` tidak ditemukan, atau berkas belum diunggah atau\ntidak sesuai metadata saat publish.\n",
        "content": {
          "application/json": {
            "schema": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "Unauthorized": {
        "description": "Header `X-Edit-Token` tidak ada atau tidak cocok.",
        "content": {
          "application/json": {
            "schema": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "NotFound": {
        "description": "Surat tidak ada, belum terbit, sudah kedaluwarsa, atau sudah dihapus.",
        "content": {
          "application/json": {
            "schema": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "RateLimited": {
        "description": "Terlalu banyak surat dari IP yang sama.",
        "headers": {
          "Retry-After": {
            "description": "Detik sampai boleh mencoba lagi.",
            "schema": {
              "type": "integer"
            }
          }
        },
        "content": {
          "application/json": {
            "schema": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "schemas": {
      "Id": {
        "type": "string",
        "pattern": "^[A-Za-z0-9_-]{1,40}$",
        "description": "Id elemen, kunci foto, atau id stiker."
      },
      "Slug": {
        "type": "string",
        "pattern": "^[A-Za-z0-9]{10}$",
        "description": "10 karakter acak base62.",
        "examples": [
          "x7Kp2qLm9A"
        ]
      },
      "LetterDesign": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "Id preset dari `packages/presets/letter.json`, bukan nilai warnanya. Server menolak id\nyang tidak ada di preset.\n",
        "required": [
          "illustration",
          "shape",
          "foilMode",
          "foilBorder",
          "foilColor",
          "paper",
          "template"
        ],
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "properties": {
          "illustration": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Id ilustrasi (`meadow`, `sprig`, `night`, …) atau `upload` untuk foto user."
          },
          "shape": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "`original`, `portrait`, `square`, `landscape`, …"
          },
          "foilMode": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "`design`, `detail`, `shadow`, `color`. `design` tidak boleh dipakai bersama `upload`."
          },
          "foilBorder": {
            "type": "boolean"
          },
          "foilColor": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "`gold`, `silver`, `rose-gold`, `copper`, `pink`, `holo`, …"
          },
          "paper": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "`white`, `cream`, `blush`, `sage`, `sky`, `navy`, …"
          },
          "template": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "`text`, `photo-1`, `photo-2`, `collage-4`, …"
          }
        }
      },
      "LetterContent": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "Elemen halaman surat. Posisi dan ukuran relatif terhadap halaman. Urutan `elements`\nadalah urutan tumpukan (terakhir paling atas). Maksimal 4 teks, 4 foto, dan 16 stiker;\nsatu foto hanya dipakai sekali.\n",
        "required": [
          "version",
          "elements"
        ],
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "properties": {
          "version": {
            "const": 1
          },
          "elements": {
            "type": "array",
            "maxItems": 24,
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/LetterElement"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "LetterElement": {
        "oneOf": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/TextElement"
          },
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/PhotoElement"
          },
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/StickerElement"
          }
        ],
        "discriminator": {
          "propertyName": "kind",
          "mapping": {
            "text": "#/components/schemas/TextElement",
            "photo": "#/components/schemas/PhotoElement",
            "sticker": "#/components/schemas/StickerElement"
          }
        }
      },
      "ElementBase": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "id",
          "x",
          "y",
          "width",
          "rotation"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "id": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Id"
          },
          "x": {
            "type": "number",
            "minimum": 0,
            "maximum": 1,
            "description": "Titik tengah, pecahan lebar halaman."
          },
          "y": {
            "type": "number",
            "minimum": 0,
            "maximum": 1,
            "description": "Titik tengah, pecahan tinggi halaman."
          },
          "width": {
            "type": "number",
            "minimum": 0.05,
            "maximum": 1,
            "description": "Lebar elemen, pecahan lebar halaman."
          },
          "rotation": {
            "type": "number",
            "minimum": -180,
            "maximum": 180,
            "description": "Derajat searah jarum jam."
          }
        }
      },
      "TextElement": {
        "unevaluatedProperties": false,
        "allOf": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ElementBase"
          },
          {
            "type": "object",
            "required": [
              "kind",
              "text",
              "size",
              "align"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "kind": {
                "const": "text"
              },
              "text": {
                "type": "string",
                "minLength": 1,
                "maxLength": 600,
                "description": "Maksimal 600 code point, tanpa karakter NUL. Tidak boleh kosong saat dikirim."
              },
              "size": {
                "type": "number",
                "minimum": 0.02,
                "maximum": 0.25,
                "description": "Ukuran huruf, pecahan lebar halaman."
              },
              "align": {
                "type": "string",
                "enum": [
                  "left",
                  "center",
                  "right"
                ]
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "PhotoElement": {
        "unevaluatedProperties": false,
        "allOf": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ElementBase"
          },
          {
            "type": "object",
            "required": [
              "kind",
              "photo",
              "aspect"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "kind": {
                "const": "photo"
              },
              "photo": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Id",
                "description": "Kunci di `photos`. Slot kosong (`null`) tidak boleh dikirim."
              },
              "aspect": {
                "type": "number",
                "minimum": 0.2,
                "maximum": 5,
                "description": "Lebar dibagi tinggi bingkai."
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "StickerElement": {
        "unevaluatedProperties": false,
        "allOf": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ElementBase"
          },
          {
            "type": "object",
            "required": [
              "kind",
              "sticker"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "kind": {
                "const": "sticker"
              },
              "sticker": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Id",
                "description": "Id stiker dari preset."
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "ImageMeta": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "Metadata foto setelah dikompres dan EXIF-nya dibuang di browser.",
        "required": [
          "type",
          "width",
          "height",
          "size"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "type": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "image/jpeg",
              "image/webp"
            ]
          },
          "width": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 1,
            "maximum": 2048
          },
          "height": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 1,
            "maximum": 2048
          },
          "size": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 1,
            "maximum": 500000,
            "description": "Byte."
          }
        }
      },
      "CoverMeta": {
        "description": "Gambar depan dari foto user. Batasnya sama dengan foto isi.",
        "unevaluatedProperties": false,
        "allOf": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ImageMeta"
          }
        ]
      },
      "PhotoMeta": {
        "unevaluatedProperties": false,
        "allOf": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ImageMeta"
          },
          {
            "type": "object",
            "required": [
              "key"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "key": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Id"
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "OgMeta": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "Sampul kartu untuk preview link. Frontend mengirim JPEG; PNG dari foto hampir selalu melewati 300 KB.",
        "required": [
          "type",
          "width",
          "height",
          "size"
        ],
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "properties": {
          "type": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "image/jpeg",
              "image/png"
            ]
          },
          "width": {
            "const": 1200
          },
          "height": {
            "const": 630
          },
          "size": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 1,
            "maximum": 300000,
            "description": "Byte."
          }
        }
      },
      "CreateLetterRequest": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "design",
          "content",
          "photos",
          "og"
        ],
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "properties": {
          "design": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/LetterDesign"
          },
          "content": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/LetterContent"
          },
          "cover": {
            "description": "Wajib kalau `design.illustration` bernilai `upload`, selain itu harus kosong. Tidak dihitung ke batas 4 foto.",
            "oneOf": [
              {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/CoverMeta"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ]
          },
          "photos": {
            "type": "array",
            "maxItems": 4,
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/PhotoMeta"
            }
          },
          "og": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/OgMeta"
          },
          "replyTo": {
            "description": "Slug surat yang dibalas lewat \"Bikin balasan\".",
            "oneOf": [
              {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Slug"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "UploadTarget": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "Tujuan upload satu berkas. Berlaku 2 jam.",
        "required": [
          "path",
          "token",
          "signedUrl"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "path": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Path di bucket `letter-assets`, `<letterId>/<uuid>.<ext>`."
          },
          "token": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Token untuk `uploadToSignedUrl(path, token, file)`."
          },
          "signedUrl": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "uri",
            "description": "URL lengkap kalau mengunggah tanpa supabase-js (PUT dengan body berkas)."
          }
        }
      },
      "CreateLetterResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "id",
          "editToken",
          "draftExpiresAt",
          "uploads"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "id": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "uuid"
          },
          "editToken": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Hanya dikirim sekali. Simpan di browser untuk publish dan hapus."
          },
          "draftExpiresAt": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date-time",
            "description": "Batas publish; setelah ini draf dan berkasnya dihapus."
          },
          "uploads": {
            "type": "object",
            "required": [
              "cover",
              "photos",
              "og"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "cover": {
                "oneOf": [
                  {
                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/UploadTarget"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "null"
                  }
                ]
              },
              "photos": {
                "type": "object",
                "description": "Per kunci foto.",
                "additionalProperties": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/UploadTarget"
                }
              },
              "og": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/UploadTarget"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "PublishLetterResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "slug",
          "url",
          "publishedAt",
          "expiresAt"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "slug": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Slug"
          },
          "url": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "uri",
            "examples": [
              "https://postpocket.vercel.app/l/x7Kp2qLm9A"
            ]
          },
          "publishedAt": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date-time"
          },
          "expiresAt": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date-time",
            "description": "`publishedAt` + 30 hari."
          }
        }
      },
      "Asset": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "Berkas publik di bucket `letter-assets`.",
        "required": [
          "url",
          "width",
          "height"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "url": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "uri"
          },
          "width": {
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "height": {
            "type": "integer"
          }
        }
      },
      "Letter": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "slug",
          "design",
          "content",
          "cover",
          "photos",
          "og",
          "replyTo",
          "publishedAt",
          "expiresAt",
          "openedAt",
          "photosExpireAt",
          "photosDeletedAt"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "slug": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Slug"
          },
          "design": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/LetterDesign"
          },
          "content": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/LetterContent"
          },
          "cover": {
            "description": "`null` kalau gambar depannya ilustrasi, atau fotonya sudah dihapus.",
            "oneOf": [
              {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Asset"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ]
          },
          "photos": {
            "type": "object",
            "description": "Per kunci foto. Kosong (`{}`) setelah foto dihapus; slot di `content` tetap ada dan ditampilkan sebagai placeholder.",
            "additionalProperties": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Asset"
            }
          },
          "og": {
            "description": "`null` setelah dihapus bersama cover. Frontend memakai gambar OG bawaan.",
            "oneOf": [
              {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Asset"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ]
          },
          "replyTo": {
            "description": "Slug surat yang dibalas, kalau masih berlaku.",
            "oneOf": [
              {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Slug"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ]
          },
          "publishedAt": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date-time"
          },
          "expiresAt": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date-time"
          },
          "openedAt": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ],
            "format": "date-time"
          },
          "photosExpireAt": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ],
            "format": "date-time",
            "description": "`openedAt` + 7 hari, dibatasi `expiresAt`. `null` kalau belum dibuka."
          },
          "photosDeletedAt": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ],
            "format": "date-time",
            "description": "Terisi begitu foto tidak ditampilkan lagi (sama dengan `photosExpireAt`, atau waktu job menghapusnya). Selama terisi, `photos` kosong."
          }
        }
      },
      "OpenLetterResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "openedAt",
          "photosExpireAt"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "openedAt": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date-time"
          },
          "photosExpireAt": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date-time"
          }
        }
      },
      "Error": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "error"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "error": {
            "type": "object",
            "required": [
              "code",
              "message"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "code": {
                "type": "string",
                "enum": [
                  "invalid_request",
                  "invalid_design",
                  "invalid_content",
                  "photo_mismatch",
                  "cover_mismatch",
                  "reply_not_found",
                  "upload_missing",
                  "upload_invalid",
                  "unauthorized",
                  "not_found",
                  "rate_limited",
                  "internal"
                ]
              },
              "message": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "Penjelasan untuk developer, bukan untuk ditampilkan ke user."
              },
              "details": {
                "type": "array",
                "description": "Lokasi field yang bermasalah, misalnya `content.elements[2].size`.",
                "items": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "required": [
                    "path",
                    "message"
                  ],
                  "properties": {
                    "path": {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "message": {
                      "type": "string"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}